{"seq":4,"slug":"team-adoption","title":"Team Adoption","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-coding-workflows-applied/team-adoption","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"shared-rules-and-context","title":"共享规则与上下文资产","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-coding-workflows-applied/team-adoption/shared-rules-and-context","wordCount":2305,"readingTime":10},{"seq":2,"slug":"ai-review-pipeline","title":"AI 评审流水线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-coding-workflows-applied/team-adoption/ai-review-pipeline","wordCount":2237,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"measuring-ai-impact","title":"度量 AI 对交付的影响","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-coding-workflows-applied/team-adoption/measuring-ai-impact","wordCount":2358,"readingTime":10}],"introMarkdown":"AI 编码工作流的价值要从个人提效走向团队规模化，关键在于把分散在个人手里的用法沉淀为可治理的组织资产。这一章讨论三个支柱：把项目指令、skills 与规则做成版本化的共享上下文资产；把 AI 审查嵌入 PR 流程形成机械首过加人审聚焦的评审流水线；以及用多维度指标度量 AI 对吞吐、质量与开发者体验的真实影响。三者合在一起，回答的是同一个问题——团队如何系统性地、可验证地用好 AI。\n"}